            "caption": "<p></p><h3><strong>For the Nighttime Ritual Obsessed– DreamWell</strong>™<strong> 1 Gallon</strong> </h3><p>Give the nighttime ritual obsessed person in your life the gift of deep hydration. The DreamWellTM is a sleep lover's dream, designed to maintain optimal moisture levels to support better sleep and healthier skin. Winter dryness doesn’t stand a chance.  </p><p>Why they’ll love it: </p><ul><li>Adds essential moisture to the air to combat dryness, flaking, and irritation. </li><li>Drop your favorite aroma on the aroma stone for a soothing atmosphere </li><li>Personalize bedtime with 3 dreamy mood light options for total relaxation </li><li>Whisper-quiet and sleek appearance, perfect for bedside tables or vanities. </li></ul><p></p><p><em>Perfect for:</em> Nighttime ritual enthusiasts, sleep lovers, beauty minimalists and maximalists, self-care lovers </p>",
            "caption_style": "p2",
            "product": "dreamwell-humidifier-1-gallon-stone-grey"
          }
        },
