            "image_desktop": "shopify://shop_images/Blog_Image-1_1_d96ba162-b532-4dfa-a204-6d21f8e1283f.png",
            "caption": "<p></p><h3><strong>For the Sleep-Obsessed – Mini Restful</strong>™<strong> Sunrise Clock Air Purifier</strong> </h3><p>For the person in your life who is <em>deeply </em>committed to perfecting their sleep routine, the Mini RestfulTM Sunrise Clock Air Purifier is the ultimate bedside upgrade. Pairing gentle sunrise simulation wakeups and clean air technology, this device helps sleepers wind down peacefully and wake up naturally refreshed. </p><p>Why they’ll love it: </p><ul><li>Sunrise simulation to wake up gradually and calmly </li><li>Build in air purification to remove allergens and pollutants for cleaner nighttime breathing </li><li>Compact design to fit perfectly on any nightstand  </li><li>Soft ambient light and soothing sounds to create a calming bedtime ritual </li></ul><p></p><p><em>Perfect for: </em>sleep lovers, early risers, light sleepers, wellness seekers </p>",
            "caption_style": "p2",
            "product": "mini-restful-midnight"
          }
        },
