            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Blog_Image-4.png",
            "image_desktop": "shopify://shop_images/Blog_Image-4.png",
            "caption": "<p></p><h3><strong>For the Interior Design Lovers – Blue Signature</strong> </h3><p>Who says you can’t have it all? This one is for the person in your life who loves their home aesthetics <em>and </em>wants to purify their air. The Blue Signature is a showpiece air purifier that blends performance and design. This product elevates any room while quietly refreshing the air.  </p><p>Why they’ll love it: </p><ul><li>Beautiful, minimalist Scandinavian design </li><li>Smart app connectivity to track your air quality and filter life </li><li>Quiet operation to preserve their perfectly curated atmosphere </li><li>Customizable filters to match their room design </li><li>App and Wi-Fi connectivity </li></ul><p><em>Perfect for: </em>modern home decorators, new homeowners, design maximalists and minimalists </p>",
