            "image_desktop": "shopify://shop_images/Blog_Image-3.png",
            "caption": "<p></p><h3><strong>For the Pet Parents – PetAir Pro</strong> </h3><p>We all know a pet parent that wants the best for their fur baby. The PetAir Pro is engineered to capture pet hair, dander, and stubborn smells to keep spaces fresh and comfortable. </p><p>Why they’ll love it: </p><ul><li>Excellent as reducing pet odors </li><li>Captures hair and dander that can irritate allergies </li><li>Helps maintain a clean, pet-friendly environment </li><li>Provides a cozy space for their pet to rest their head </li><li>App and Wi-Fi connectivity </li></ul><p></p><p><em>Perfect for: </em>dog parents, cat parents, anyone living with a lovable shedding machine </p>",
